        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Something’s not right. Have you noticed?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Out of Place: Origin</strong> is a survival game built on your power of observation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use Your Camera and Discover the Anomalies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The night shift has begun.<br>Your old, worn-out camera is the only guide you have in this strange place.<br>It looks like an ordinary diner — but here, the walls breathe, objects move, and the shadows seem to watch you.<br>Your task is simple: detect the abnormalities — the <i>anomalies</i> — capture them, and collect evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with every photo you take, as you get closer to the truth, something else might start noticing <strong>you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097370/extras/c25c74bec7edaa4e317bb44264e6f1df.poster.avif?t=1781175742\" width=426 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097370/extras/c25c74bec7edaa4e317bb44264e6f1df.webm?t=1781175742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Report Anomalies from the Terminal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Report every anomaly you find through the terminal.<br>If your photo is correct, the system will display <strong>“Anomaly Detected.”</strong><br>Make a mistake, and your entire shift could reset.<br>It may sound simple, but this job demands focus and patience.<br>And remember — time doesn’t stop while the upload continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097370/extras/ec9b019c08c4c6bc4d424c5a38cd3656.poster.avif?t=1781175742\" width=426 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097370/extras/ec9b019c08c4c6bc4d424c5a38cd3656.webm?t=1781175742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive by Controlling the Doors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As darkness slowly surrounds you, your only defense is the <strong>doors.</strong><br>Your energy is limited, your resources few.<br>Close them at the right moment, wait when you must…<br>because <strong>those behind the door will show you no mercy.</strong><br>Every choice has a consequence, every second has a cost.<br>And sometimes, to survive… all you need to do is <strong>turn off the light.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097370/extras/21c0f24936a9c34966c7b3f23ddf6d0b.poster.avif?t=1781175742\" width=426 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097370/extras/21c0f24936a9c34966c7b3f23ddf6d0b.webm?t=1781175742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep Your Eyes Open</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because sometimes,<br>the thing watching you…<br><strong>might not be an error.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Something’s not right. Have you noticed?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Out of Place: Origin</strong> is a survival game built on your power of observation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use Your Camera and Discover the Anomalies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The night shift has begun.<br>Your old, worn-out camera is the only guide you have in this strange place.<br>It looks like an ordinary diner — but here, the walls breathe, objects move, and the shadows seem to watch you.<br>Your task is simple: detect the abnormalities — the <i>anomalies</i> — capture them, and collect evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with every photo you take, as you get closer to the truth, something else might start noticing <strong>you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097370/extras/c25c74bec7edaa4e317bb44264e6f1df.poster.avif?t=1781175742\" width=426 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097370/extras/c25c74bec7edaa4e317bb44264e6f1df.webm?t=1781175742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Report Anomalies from the Terminal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Report every anomaly you find through the terminal.<br>If your photo is correct, the system will display <strong>“Anomaly Detected.”</strong><br>Make a mistake, and your entire shift could reset.<br>It may sound simple, but this job demands focus and patience.<br>And remember — time doesn’t stop while the upload continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097370/extras/ec9b019c08c4c6bc4d424c5a38cd3656.poster.avif?t=1781175742\" width=426 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097370/extras/ec9b019c08c4c6bc4d424c5a38cd3656.webm?t=1781175742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive by Controlling the Doors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As darkness slowly surrounds you, your only defense is the <strong>doors.</strong><br>Your energy is limited, your resources few.<br>Close them at the right moment, wait when you must…<br>because <strong>those behind the door will show you no mercy.</strong><br>Every choice has a consequence, every second has a cost.<br>And sometimes, to survive… all you need to do is <strong>turn off the light.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097370/extras/21c0f24936a9c34966c7b3f23ddf6d0b.poster.avif?t=1781175742\" width=426 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097370/extras/21c0f24936a9c34966c7b3f23ddf6d0b.webm?t=1781175742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep Your Eyes Open</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because sometimes,<br>the thing watching you…<br><strong>might not be an error.</strong></p>",
